@startuml
title CampusEnroll HA - Arquitectura actual y preparada

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

legend right
|= Estado |= Significado |
|<back:#D5F5E3>Implementado| Flujo o componente en uso actual |
|<back:#FCF3CF>Configurado / preparado| Existe en repo o infraestructura, con integracion parcial |
|<back:#FADBD8>Pendiente| Planeado para entrega final |
endlegend

actor "Usuario tecnico" as user
rectangle "Postman\ncliente actual de prueba" as postman #D5F5E3
component "API Gateway\nentry point objetivo" as gateway #FADBD8

node "Servicios backend\nse ejecutan fuera de Compose" {
  component "student-service" as student #D5F5E3
  component "course-service" as course #D5F5E3
  component "enrollment-service" as enrollment #D5F5E3
  component "billing-service" as billing #D5F5E3
  component "notification\nsolo health check" as notification #D5F5E3
}

node "Docker Compose local\ninfraestructura compartida" as compose #FCF3CF {
  database "PostgreSQL" as pg #D5F5E3
  component "Redis" as redis #FCF3CF
  queue "RabbitMQ" as mq #FCF3CF
  component "Prometheus\nself-scrape actual" as prom #FCF3CF
  component "Grafana\ncontenedor listo" as grafana #FCF3CF
}

user --> postman
postman --> student : HTTP directo
postman --> course : HTTP directo
postman --> enrollment : HTTP directo
postman --> billing : HTTP directo
postman --> notification : HTTP directo

postman ..> gateway : uso futuro
gateway ..> student : enrutamiento planeado
gateway ..> course : enrutamiento planeado
gateway ..> enrollment : enrutamiento planeado
gateway ..> billing : enrutamiento planeado
gateway ..> notification : enrutamiento planeado

student --> pg : persistencia
course --> pg : persistencia
enrollment --> pg : persistencia
billing --> pg : persistencia

course ..> redis : cache futura
enrollment ..> redis : disponibilidad futura
student ..> redis : uso eventual

enrollment ..> mq : eventos planeados
billing ..> mq : eventos planeados
mq ..> notification : consumo planeado

prom --> prom : scrape actual
prom ..> student : scrape planeado
prom ..> course : scrape planeado
prom ..> enrollment : scrape planeado
prom ..> billing : scrape planeado
prom ..> notification : scrape planeado
grafana --> prom : dashboards y consultas

note bottom of gateway
No hay evidencia de gateway operativo
como punto de entrada de negocio.
La coleccion Postman usa URLs directas por servicio.
end note

note bottom of redis
Redis ya existe en Compose,
pero aun no esta integrado a la logica de negocio.
end note

note bottom of mq
RabbitMQ ya existe en Compose,
pero los flujos asincronos de negocio siguen pendientes.
end note

note bottom of compose
El Compose actual levanta solo infraestructura compartida,
no todos los microservicios de negocio.
end note

@enduml
